%% AstraNotes - Activity Diagram (FR-04 toggle privacy)
%% Covers the two paths the create-private diagram does NOT cover:
%% (a) toggle-back from private to plaintext, and
%% (b) decrypt-failure during a toggle attempt - note stays encrypted.

flowchart TD
    Start([User invokes 'toggle privacy' for note id]) --> Get[NoteRepository.get id]
    Get --> Found{Note exists?}
    Found -- no --> RaiseNF[Raise NoteNotFoundError - SPR-02]
    RaiseNF --> Surface1[CLI surfaces user-friendly message]
    Surface1 --> End([End])

    Found -- yes --> Branch{Current is_private?}

    Branch -- yes --> TryDecrypt[PrivacyService.decrypt body]
    TryDecrypt --> DecOk{Decrypt succeeded?}
    DecOk -- no --> RaiseDec[Raise PersistenceError, KEEP note encrypted - FR-04]
    RaiseDec --> Surface2[CLI surfaces user-friendly message<br/>note remains private and encrypted]
    Surface2 --> End
    DecOk -- yes --> WritePlain[Save Note with plaintext body, is_private=False<br/>modified_at = now UTC]

    Branch -- no --> Encrypt[PrivacyService.encrypt body]
    Encrypt --> WriteCipher[Save Note with Fernet ciphertext, is_private=True<br/>modified_at = now UTC]

    WritePlain --> SaveOk{Write succeeded?}
    WriteCipher --> SaveOk
    SaveOk -- no --> RaiseP[Catch OSError, raise PersistenceError - SPR-02]
    RaiseP --> Surface3[CLI surfaces user-friendly message]
    Surface3 --> End
    SaveOk -- yes --> Confirm[CLI prints 'privacy toggled' with new state]
    Confirm --> End
